.TH starforge-explain-error 1  StarForge "User Manual"
.SH NAME
starforge-explain-error \- Explain a stable StarForge error code
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstarforge explain-error\fR \fICODE\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the cause, fix, process exit status, and documentation link for a stable StarForge error code.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fICODE\fR
Error code, for example SF1203.
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0